    {
      "title": "The monster in ice",
      "text": "Talk to Erjolf.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What should we do now?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Yes, look at the creature."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Exit the cave, climb down the mountain and go north across the narrow strip of land. Head north-east and past the sabre-toothed kyatts in the Rellekka Hunter area.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to the natural historian.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Don't you know what a yeti looks like?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Are you any good at identifying creatures?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Okay, I can start describing it now."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Describe the creature to him.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "It's yellow."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "It has four arms."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "It has no legs, like a snail."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "It has spikes, which run down its spine."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "It has a spiky tail, with vicious spines."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "It has pincers, like a crab."
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue dialogue with the historian.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What is the creature I described?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Where can I find out more about this creature?"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Terror of the mind",
      "text": "Head north of Pollnivneach along the River Elid to a sand pile.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Dig the sand pile.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "After Ali the Wise speaks, talk again and ask about the Muspah.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I've found a creature just like this statue."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Why do you think the creature I've found is a myth?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "If the Muspah is a myth, how could I have found it?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "How can I clear the ice from around the Muspah?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Can you help me get back to the Muspah cave?"
        }
      ],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "title": "The muspah's true form",
      "text": "Head back to the Muspah cave.<ul><li>The ice cave where you started, by Fremennik Province lodestone, or fairy ring DKS.</li></ul>",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [
        {
          "name": "Sapphire",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Water rune",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        },
        {
          "name": "Cosmic rune",
          "itemId": -1,
          "quantity": 1,
          "duringQuest": false
        }
      ],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "If you haven't obtained sapphires yet, mine the sapphire rocks nearby.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cross the floating bridge.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bore-sapphires in the ice block, then enchant-sapphires on it.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Pick up the four sapphires from the ground, or more will have to be obtained.",
      "actions": [],
      "postconditions": [],
      "jumpconditions": [],
      "jumpOffset": 0,
      "neededItems": [],
      "recommendedItems": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk to the Muspah and offer to help.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "I only wanted to help!"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "That's okay."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "What were you doing in the ice?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Tell me about the rejuvenation ritual."
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "So what do you need now?"
        },
        {
          "t": "conversationHighlight",
          "text": "Never mind."
        }
